<title>NORWAY: Orkla 1996 profits per division.</title>
<headline>Orkla 1996 profits per division.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Orkla ASA operating results per division for 12 months to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(millions of crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Foods				     608	 vs	  368</p>
<p> Beverages				 300	 vs	  245</p>
<p> Brands				    431	 vs	  360</p>
<p> Media				     175	 vs	  161</p>
<p> Eliminations				0	 vs	    0</p>
<p> Total branded consumer goods    1,514	 vs	1,134</p>
<p> Chemicals				 441	 vs	  543</p>
<p> Unallocated/eliminations    minus 124	 vs   minus 10</p>
<p> Other income/costs		     20	 vs	  127</p>
<p> Total industry			1,851	 vs	1,764</p>
<p> Investments				65	 vs	   20</p>
<p> Total operating result	    1,916	 vs	1,784</p>
<p>-- Rolf Soderlind, Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
